hese and you just fold it downward and  then you're going to just pinch it like  that now you have a head and then the  tail is fine just like that so now all  you have to do is to fold down the wings  and there you go you have your paper  crane now if you want to round off the  wings a little bit that's fine so it  looks more like that and to make it  stand what you do is you just kind of  bend these out and then you could have a  standing paper crane okay so I hope you  were able to make your paper crane and  that you enjoyed the tutorial please  rate and comment below to let me know  what you thought and also if you would  like to see how to make the paper  rocketship as well thanks for watching  guys
 

